id":"snowfall_speech_ludmilla_16_13","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:snowfall_speech_ludmilla_16_13","text":"For the lucky hot spring event this afternoon,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"snowfall_speech_ludmilla_16_14","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:snowfall_speech_ludmilla_16_14","text":"Blanc and Noir instructed everyone to toss coins into a basket that was floating in the hot spring.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"snowfall_speech_ludmilla_16_15","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:snowfall_speech_ludmilla_16_15","text":"Unlike the other Nikkes, who had been able to toss the coin into the basket with a natural ease, Ludmilla had had something of a hard time with it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"snowfall_speech_ludmilla_16_16","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:snowfall_speech_ludmilla_16_16","text":"It was only near the end of the event that she was able to toss the coin into the basket with the help of Mica.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"snowfall_speech_ludmilla_16_17","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:snowfall_speech_ludmilla_16_17","text":"She stands before me fidgeting with the coin somewhat ambivalently.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"snowfall_speech_ludmilla_16_18","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:snowfall_speech_ludmilla_16_18","text":"You were able to toss the coin inside the basket, so everything will be fine.","jump":"snowfall_speech_ludmilla_16_20","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"snowfall_speech_ludmilla_16_19","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:snowfall_speech_ludmilla_16_19","text":"Do you want to head back to the hot spring?","jump":"snowfall_speech_ludmilla_16_26","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"snowfall_speech_ludmilla_16_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:snowfall_speech_ludmilla_16_20","text":"You're right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"snowfall_speech_ludmilla_16_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:snowfall_speech_ludmilla_16_21","text":"I know that's how we were supposed to receive luck from Noir and Blanc,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"snowfall_speech_ludmilla_16_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:snowfall_speech_ludmilla_16_22","text":"but I feel differently.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"snowfall_speech_ludmilla_16_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:snowfall_speech_ludmilla_16_23","text":"I don't think that's the right way to go about it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"snowfall_speech_ludmilla_16_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:snowfall_speech_ludmilla_16_24","text":"If you find yourself in need of luck, you should work for it yourself.","jump":nul